I just wanted to let you all know that System Crafters has been on hold for the past few months.  My focus has shifted to other projects and I haven’t been producing new videos, streams, or content for the channel in that time.  I’d love to bring it back in the future once I find an interesting new thread to pull that fits with the channel’s ethos, but I don’t know when that will be, and I don’t want to continue accepting your support while nothing is happening.
